<style>
  .dashboard-action-panel {
    padding-top: 0;
    margin-top: -2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .dashboard-action-box {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.4rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(226 232 240);
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    background: white;
  }

  .dashboard-action-view {
    display: none;
  }

  .dashboard-action-view.is-active {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }

  /* Section header */
  .dashboard-action-heading {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .dashboard-action-heading h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: rgb(15 23 42);
  }

  .dashboard-action-heading p {
    color: rgb(100 116 139);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* Forms */
  .dashboard-form {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .dashboard-form-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .dashboard-field {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .dashboard-field span {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgb(51 65 85);
  }

  .dashboard-input,
  .dashboard-textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid rgb(203 213 225);
    border-radius: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 0.95rem;
    color: rgb(15 23 42);
    background: rgb(248 250 252);
    font: inherit;
    outline: none;
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s ease,
      box-shadow 0.2s ease,
      background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .dashboard-textarea {
    min-height: 120px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .dashboard-input:focus,
  .dashboard-textarea:focus {
    border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.55);
    background: white;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.08);
  }

  .dashboard-input:disabled {
    cursor: not-allowed;
    color: rgb(100 116 139);
    background: rgb(241 245 249);
  }

  .dashboard-submit {
    justify-self: start;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    color: white;
    background: rgb(79 70 229);
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background-color 0.25s ease,
      transform 0.2s ease,
      box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .dashboard-submit:hover {
    background: rgb(67 56 202);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25);
  }

  .dashboard-submit:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
  }

  .dashboard-submit:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.35);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .dashboard-submit:disabled {
    cursor: wait;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* Dynamic history rendered from dashboard.astro */
  :global(.dashboard-empty-state) {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px dashed rgb(203 213 225);
    color: rgb(100 116 139);
    background: rgb(248 250 252);
  }

  /* Empty service state */
  .dashboard-action-warning {
    display: none;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.95rem;
    color: rgb(146 64 14);
    background: rgb(255 251 235);
    border: 1px solid rgb(253 230 138);
  }

  .dashboard-action-box.has-no-service .dashboard-action-warning {
    display: block;
  }

  .dashboard-action-box.has-no-service [data-requires-service] {
    opacity: 0.55;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* History lists */
  .dashboard-history {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .dashboard-history-title {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: rgb(15 23 42);
  }

  .dashboard-history-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  :global(.dashboard-history-item) {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 0.95rem;
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    background: rgb(248 250 252);
    border: 1px solid rgb(226 232 240);
  }

  :global(.dashboard-history-item-header) {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  :global(.dashboard-history-item strong) {
    color: rgb(15 23 42);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  :global(.dashboard-history-item span) {
    color: rgb(100 116 139);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }

  :global(.dashboard-history-delete) {
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.32rem 0.65rem;
    color: rgb(185 28 28);
    background: rgb(254 242 242);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  :global(.dashboard-history-delete:hover) {
    background: rgb(254 226 226);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .dashboard-form-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .dashboard-action-panel:not(:last-child) {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(226 232 240);
  }
</style>

<div class="dashboard-action-panel">
  <div class="dashboard-action-box" id="dashboard-action-panel">
    <div class="dashboard-action-warning">
      Necesitas tener un servicio activo para solicitar cambios o crear tickets.
    </div>

    <section class="dashboard-action-view is-active" data-action-view="change" data-requires-service>
      <div class="dashboard-action-heading">
        <h3>Solicitar cambio</h3>
        <p>Env&iacute;a ajustes menores del sitio seleccionado. Lo guardaremos asociado a esa web.</p>
      </div>

      <form class="dashboard-form" data-dashboard-form="change">
        <label class="dashboard-field">
          <span>Titulo</span>
          <input class="dashboard-input" name="title" placeholder="Ej. Cambiar texto de inicio" required />
        </label>

        <label class="dashboard-field">
          <span>Detalle</span>
          <textarea class="dashboard-textarea" name="description" placeholder="Describe exactamente que quieres cambiar." required></textarea>
        </label>

        <button class="dashboard-submit" type="submit">Enviar solicitud</button>
      </form>

      <div class="dashboard-history">
        <p class="dashboard-history-title">&Uacute;ltimas solicitudes</p>
        <div class="dashboard-history-list" id="dashboard-change-history">
          <div class="dashboard-empty-state">A&uacute;n no tienes solicitudes recientes.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dashboard-action-view" data-action-view="billing">
      <div class="dashboard-action-heading">
        <h3>Recibos</h3>
        <p>Descarga tus recibos de pago cuando est&eacute;n disponibles.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="dashboard-invoices" class="dashboard-empty-state">
        A&uacute;n no tienes recibos disponibles.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dashboard-action-view" data-action-view="security">
      <div class="dashboard-action-heading">
        <h3>Cuenta y seguridad</h3>
        <p>Actualiza tu nombre o cambia tu contrase&ntilde;a.</p>
      </div>

      <form class="dashboard-form" data-dashboard-form="profile">
        <div class="dashboard-form-grid">
          <label class="dashboard-field">
            <span>Correo</span>
            <input class="dashboard-input" id="dashboard-profile-email" type="email" disabled />
          </label>

          <label class="dashboard-field">
            <span>Nombre</span>
            <input
              class="dashboard-input"
              id="dashboard-profile-name"
              name="name"
              placeholder="Tu nombre"
              pattern="[A-Za-zÁÉÍÓÚáéíóúÑñ ]+"
              autocomplete="name"
              required
            />
          </label>

          <label class="dashboard-field">
            <span>Tel&eacute;fono</span>
            <input
              class="dashboard-input"
              id="dashboard-profile-phone"
              name="phone"
              inputmode="numeric"
              pattern="[0-9]*"
              autocomplete="tel"
              placeholder="Ej. 999999999"
            />
          </label>
        </div>

        <button class="dashboard-submit" type="submit">Guardar datos</button>
      </form>

      <form class="dashboard-form" data-dashboard-form="password">
        <div class="dashboard-form-grid">
          <label class="dashboard-field">
            <span>Contrase&ntilde;a actual</span>
            <input class="dashboard-input" name="current_password" type="password" required />
          </label>

          <label class="dashboard-field">
            <span>Nueva contrase&ntilde;a</span>
            <input class="dashboard-input" name="new_password" type="password" required />
          </label>
        </div>

        <button class="dashboard-submit" type="submit">Cambiar contrase&ntilde;a</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section class="dashboard-action-view" data-action-view="support" data-requires-service>
      <div class="dashboard-action-heading">
        <h3>Soporte</h3>
        <p>Crea un ticket para dudas, errores o ayuda con tu servicio.</p>
      </div>

      <form class="dashboard-form" data-dashboard-form="support">
        <label class="dashboard-field">
          <span>Asunto</span>
          <input class="dashboard-input" name="subject" placeholder="Ej. No veo mi dominio" required />
        </label>

        <label class="dashboard-field">
          <span>Mensaje</span>
          <textarea class="dashboard-textarea" name="message" placeholder="Cuentanos que sucede." required></textarea>
        </label>

        <button class="dashboard-submit" type="submit">Crear ticket</button>
      </form>

      <div class="dashboard-history">
        <p class="dashboard-history-title">&Uacute;ltimos tickets</p>
        <div class="dashboard-history-list" id="dashboard-ticket-history">
          <div class="dashboard-empty-state">A&uacute;n no tienes tickets recientes.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
